Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a trimmed mean over the most stable pool (pool3) to see if trimming improves robustness over the full pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool3","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy using a strong individual model (ETS) to see if a single model can beat the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the smaller, more stable pool2 using the inverse-error weights from w3 (which were computed on pool3) to see if a different pool improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"w3"}

Thought: Test a weighted average using the full pool with the pre‑trained w1 weights to see if a broader pool improves robustness.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

