Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with the strong THETA model to see if it beats the overall mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the inverse‑error weights derived from pool2 (w2) to see if a different weighting scheme improves over the current best mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"w2"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using the global weights w1 to see if a different pool improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"w1"}

